# Welcome

This is the documentation for **{{projectName}}** — a [FastMCP](https://gofastmcp.com)
server scaffolded with [`dude`](https://github.com/cubocicloide/dude). It exposes
MCP **tools**, **resources** (incl. templates), and **prompts** to any MCP client
(Claude Desktop, Claude Code, the MCP Inspector, …).

---

## Getting started

`dude` is the project CLI, published on the public npm registry.
so first authenticate the registry, then install the global launcher, then
provision and start the server.

```bash
# 1. Install the dude launcher globally (the only global install).
npm install -g @cubocicloide/dude-launcher

# 2. Provision the project's pinned toolchain (CLI + stack).
pnpm install

# 3. Build the image and start the server (streamable HTTP).
dude up --build
```

The server is now serving MCP over HTTP at <http://localhost:8000/mcp/>.

---

## Try it

```bash
# Explore the server with the official MCP Inspector (dev profile):
docker compose --profile dev up --build
# → open http://localhost:6274 → Transport "Streamable HTTP" → http://fastmcp:8000/mcp/
```

To **chat** with the server through an LLM, register it in Claude Desktop or
Claude Code — see [Connecting a client](connect.md).

